%% Figure 5. Historical reconstruction process (fail-closed)
flowchart TD
  Q[Reconstruction request] --> R[Resolve Decision ID]
  R --> S[Retrieve sealed objects]
  S --> V[Version + temporal validity checks]
  V --> T{Mandatory bindings present?}
  T -->|no| U[Unavailable / Failed]
  T -->|yes| Tri[Reconstruct triad:<br/>justification · authorization · temporal validity]
  Tri --> Out{Coverage}
  Out -->|all required| C[Complete]
  Out -->|some retained| P[Partial]
  Out -->|reliance deleted| F[Failed justification]
